+| Decision submit/read/comment and escalation commands | include authenticated command actor plus applicable reviewer/source hints before company/decision locks; no company→new account edge; unauthorized/missing mapping remains actual denial |
+| Role/topology refresh and principal retirement | no account lookup/lock for notices; only new feature's pending durable-event proof, exact canonical/current assignment under company lock; account retirement keeps user UPDATE then sorted company NO KEY UPDATE then member/principal/role/decision |
