+| Existing DeliveryFailure notification commit | unlock preview: discover source/principal/account/channel hints with no row locks, lock sorted users first, then company, then delivery source and event/fence; re-resolve/revalidate expected projection under these locks before outbox/notification commit. Remove the old event-first and combined account/company acquisition. |
+| Notification open/mark-read and href | mutating open uses the same hints/users/company/source/notification order before any held row. Pure href/preview reads use no FOR SHARE; they expose no payload/authority and cannot authorize commit. list/census are ordinary lock-free scoped reads and unchanged. claim/fail/reap only acquire bounded event rows and never then request company/accounts, so remain unchanged. |
+
